abstract: "A reproducible R workflow modeling seasonal vegetation anomalies in the Cholistan Desert, Pakistan, using MODIS NDVI, dynamic climate predictors (NASA POWER), terrain, and land cover, with rigorous spatial-block and temporal hold-out validation."